flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[Navigate to /login]
    B --> C[Enter email and password]
    C --> D{Client-side valid?}
    D -->|No| E[Show field validation error]
    E --> C
    D -->|Yes| F[POST /api/auth/login]
    F --> G{Credentials valid?}
    G -->|No - Invalid| H[Show: Invalid credentials]
    H --> C
    G -->|No - Deactivated| I[Show: Account is deactivated]
    I --> C
    G -->|Yes| J[Issue Sanctum token\nReturn as Bearer token]
    J --> K{User role?}
    K -->|admin / doktor| L[Redirect to /dashboard/home]
    K -->|pacijent| M[Redirect to /dashboard/home\nPatientRedirectGuard intercepts]
    M --> N[Fetch /api/patients/me]
    N --> O[Redirect to /dashboard/patients/id]
    L --> P([End])
    O --> P
